---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import avatar from "../assets/avatar.png";
---

<Layout
  title="关于 Eric - 数得其道"
  description="了解 Eric，一名工程师和系统思维实践者，专注于技术赋能业务和数字化建设"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="main">
    <div class="container page">
      <header class="about-header">
        <img
          src={avatar.src}
          alt="Eric 的头像"
          width="72"
          height="72"
          class="avatar"
        />
        <div>
          <h1 class="name">Eric</h1>
          <p class="title">工程师 · 系统思维实践者</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <blockquote class="motto">
        "技术是手段，认知是核心，行动是连接理想与现实的唯一路径。"
      </blockquote>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>关于我</h2>
        <p>我是 Eric，一名工程师，也是一位系统思维的实践者。</p>

        <p>
          多年来，我一直在探索如何用技术为业务赋能——从流程设计、数据治理到平台搭建，我始终坚持<strong
            >「不重复造轮子，一切服务业务，小步快跑」</strong
          >的理念。在构建系统时，我关注的不仅是技术选型，更在意它与业务的耦合程度与落地效果。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>专业领域</h2>
        <ul class="skills-list">
          <li>
            <span class="skill-icon">⚙️</span>
            <strong>数字化建设</strong>
            <p>企业数字化转型与系统架构设计</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="skill-icon">📊</span>
            <strong>数据治理</strong>
            <p>数据平台搭建与数据价值挖掘</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="skill-icon">🔄</span>
            <strong>流程管理</strong>
            <p>业务流程优化与自动化实现</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="skill-icon">🤖</span>
            <strong>AI 应用</strong>
            <p>人工智能技术在业务场景的落地</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>博客理念</h2>
        <p>
          这个博客，记录我在数字化建设、流程管理、数据平台、AI
          应用等领域的思考与实践，也偶尔写一些对人性、成长与父子关系的观察。
        </p>

        <ul class="principles">
          <li>
            <span class="principle-icon">🛠️</span>
            <span>不重复造轮子</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="principle-icon">🎯</span>
            <span>一切服务业务</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="principle-icon">🚀</span>
            <span>小步快跑</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>联系交流</h2>
        <p>欢迎交流，期待与你在思维的边界处相遇。</p>

        <div class="contact-links">
          <a
            href="https://x.com/deluxebear"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="contact-link"
          >
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path
                d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            X / Twitter
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://github.com/deluxebear"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="contact-link"
          >
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
              <path
                d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
            GitHub
          </a>

          <a href="/rss.xml" class="contact-link">
            <svg
              width="20"
              height="20"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.5"
            >
              <path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"></path>
              <path d="M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"></path>
              <circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1"></circle>
            </svg>
            RSS 订阅
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section">
        <h2>成长轨迹</h2>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-year">系统思维实践</span>
          <p>
            深入研究系统性思考方法，将其应用于技术架构和业务流程设计中
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-year">数字化转型</span>
          <p>
            主导多个企业数字化项目，积累了丰富的平台搭建和数据治理经验
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-year">AI 技术探索</span>
          <p>
            关注人工智能在业务场景中的实际应用，推动技术与业务的深度融合
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-year">知识分享</span>
          <p>开始记录和分享技术思考，探讨人性、成长与生活的深层思考</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .main {
    min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
    padding: 2.5rem 0 0;
  }

  .page {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .about-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .avatar {
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .name {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
  }

  .title {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .motto {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-style: normal;
    background: none;
    border-radius: 0;
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-section p,
  .about-section li {
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-section strong {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .skills-list,
  .principles {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .skills-list li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .skills-list p {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }

  .principles li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .contact-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1em;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .timeline-year {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .timeline-item p {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
